{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "category": "object-hash",
  "description": "Framed object hash (SIGE spec 6.1): SHA256(\"SIGE/object-hash/v1\" || u32be(len(type_url)) || type_url || u64be(len(canonical_cbor)) || canonical_cbor). value uses the same tagged JsonCborValue shape as cbor.json. objectHash(typeUrl, value) must equal expectedHex. Independently cross-checked against node:crypto sha256 over hand-framed bytes.",
